OL,3,GNEWSATest could 'revolutionise brain
OL,4,Atumour diagnosis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA clinical scientist has described how
OL,7,Fa rapid new test used by the NHS could
OL,8,F"revolutionise brain tumour diagnosis".
OL,10,FIn a partnership with Newcastle
OL,11,FUniversity, Newcastle Hospitals is one
OL,12,Fof five specialist centres in England
OL,13,Fto roll out the pilot test used to
OL,14,Fdiagnose which type of tumour a patient
OL,15,Fhas.
OL,17,FIt should mean patients can start
OL,18,Ftreatment including radiotherapy and
OL,19,Fchemotherapy sooner, and are spared
OL,20,Fweeks of uncertainty.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
