OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATest could 'revolutionise brain
OL,4,Atumour diagnosis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FClinical scientist Angharad Goodman
OL,7,Fsaid the test could give the
OL,8,Finformation needed within days, while
OL,9,FProf Simon Bailey, consultant
OL,10,Fpaediatric oncologist, said it would
OL,11,F"allow clarity for children and their
OL,12,Ffamilies much sooner".
